type: software
title: "singlet: Python, R and C++ client and engine for singlet.bio"
abstract: "Client packages (Python, R) and the C++ processing engine for singlet.bio, a catalog of public GEO single-cell RNA-seq studies re-processed from raw reads with one pipeline. Data are CC0; code is MIT."
